  planner_response {
    response: "I have applied the **Sophisticated Dark** design theme across all remaining components of the **TRANSFORMX** hackathon portal:\n\n- **Refined Color Palette**: Standardized backgrounds to deep mechanical tones (`#05070a`, `#0a0f1d`), with high-contrast text (`#e0e0e0`, `#ffffff`), Optimus Red accents (`#cc0000`), and Electric Blue energy glows (`#00A3FF`).\n- **Roadmap & Timeline**: Updated the Energon power conduit and milestone chassis cards with clean chamfer borders, telemetry timestamps, and tactical status markers.\n- **Registration Console**: Re-engineered the registration control station with a high-contrast transform button, hydraulic clamp status indicators, and clean squad protocol cards.\n- **Mission Briefing Modal & Reticle**: Polished the full-screen tactical theme modal and custom cursor reticle to seamlessly match the unified Sophisticated Dark sci-fi aesthetic."
